      "content": "Public HTTP API behind the Valora mobile wallet, including the open-source Divvi Hooks API (positions, shortcuts) and the token, swap-quote, NFT, and transaction-simulation endpoints the wallet consumes. This specification is DERIVED by API Evangelist from Valora's open-source code (the divvi-xyz/hooks repository, formerly valora-inc/hooks, which implements the hooks-api Google Cloud Function and consumes the other endpoints) plus live probes of the production host. Valora does not publish an OpenAPI; treat this as a faithful reconstruction, not a provider contract.",
